  "id": "navigation/declaration/07_changed_signatures",
  "topic": "navigation",
  "subtopic": "declaration",
  "title": "A definition whose declaration changed",
  "summary": "Go-to-declaration on a definition that no longer matches its declaration reaches the declaration it parted from",
  "prose": "When a parameter changes on one side only, the definition and the header\ndeclaration become two functions, and the definition has no declaration of\nits own. Go-to-declaration on it falls back to the functions of its name in\nits scope that nothing defines: the declaration that wants the same edit. An\noverload with a definition of its own is no candidate.",
